**Review criteria**:
1. Does it do what EJ asked — will a designer following it make agents use memory at the right time and in the right way, for both project memory and caches?
2. Faithful to the two designs: cited requirement ids (Rd2.1, Rd5, W5.1, W5.3, K5.2, K6.2, CACHES Rd1, B1, Rd2, routing table) right? Does it say anything they do not?
